{
  "slug": "enhanced-statusline",
  "name": "Enhanced Statusline",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Enhanced status line for Claude Code with 10 themes, feature toggles, session metrics, git status, cache tracking, and cost monitoring",
  "longDescription": "Ships **7 commands**.\n\n- **Commands** (7): `color-scheme` (Change the color scheme of the enhanced status line), `setup-statusline` (Configure the enhanced status line for this Claude Code session), `show-config` (Display current status line configuration and theme), `theme` (Switch between status line color themes), `toggle-cost` (Toggle cost monitoring display in status line), `toggle-duration` (Toggle session duration display in status line), `toggle-git` (Toggle git branch and status display in status line)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install enhanced-statusline@claude-community` from `deepan-g2/claude-statusline-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "wrapper",
